''Were you looking for [[Helmet Boss Toilet 4.0]]?''{{Character|name=Boss Toilet 4.0|image=Boss Toilet 4.0.png|imagecaption=|species=Toilet|debut=Wave 40 On [[Nightmare Mode]]|health=1,370,000 HP|speed=Slow|gender=}}
==Overview==
The '''Boss Toilet 4.0''' is a stronger version of the [[Boss Toilet 3.0]], and the previous variant of the [[Helmet Boss Toilet 4.0]]. It can stun [[units]] for 5 seconds with its four lasers. This is the second strongest variation of the Boss Toilet in game.
==Waves==
=== [[Nightmare Mode]] ===





Wave 40: 1,370,000 HP

Wave 46: 1,550,000 HP

Wave 49: 1,640,000 HP

=== Other Modes ===
Wave 1: 200,000 HP

==Strategy==
*The Boss Toilet 4.0 has a lot of health, so you should use high DPS units. Units like [[Jetpack Cameraman|Jetpack Cameraman,]] [[Titan Cameraman|Titan Cameraman,]] any [[Mythic]], or any [[Godly]] will work.
*The Boss Toilet 4.0 stuns very quickly, so you should use Medic Cameraman or Camera Repair Drone to unstun units stunned by the Boss Toilet 4.0.
*You can use Secret Agent to defeat this enemy if it is at low health.
==Trivia==
*It has glasses and headphones but is not immune to any [[TVs]] or [[Speakers]].
*It is based off of the [https://skibidi-toilet.fandom.com/wiki/G-Man_Skibidi_Toilet#G-Man_Skibidi_Toilet_4.0 G-Man Skibidi Toilet 4.0].

